        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You harmlessly place your unique magic sigil in the shape of your choice, which is about 1 square inch in size, on your targets. When you Cast the Spell, you set the duration by choosing a time at which point the sigil flashes dimly three times. After that point, the spell ends. Even though spell durations aren't normally exact, the effects of <em>synchronize</em> are precise to the second. The timer is based on the place where the spell was cast, so entering a plane or area where time flows differently changes how the time elapses in sometimes unpredictable ways.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The spell can target up to 20 willing creatures.</p>"
